            <h3>6. Privacy</h3>
            <p>We collect and process personal data only as described in our Privacy Policy. By using the site, you consent to our data practices.</p>

            <h3>7. Limitations of Liability</h3>
            <p>PCMarket is not liable for indirect damages, lost profits, or delays caused by shipping carriers or third-party vendors. Our total liability is limited to the amount paid for the purchase.</p>

            <h3>8. Changes to Terms</h3>
            <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the website after changes are posted means you accept the revised terms.</p>

            <p style="margin-top: 32px;">If you have questions, please contact our support team through the website.</p>
